{
  "culture": "gondor",
  "_note": "color=primary armor tint, color2=secondary. Both are derived from the clan's own banner_key: color is the layer-0 background palette colour, color2 is the layer-1 icon colour, resolved through <BannerColors> in banner_icons.xml. Keep them in step with the banner. The template_id/roster half is synced FROM the live files (spclans.xslt binding, taom_partyTemplates.xml stacks) by tools/sync_clan_specs_from_live.py since 2026-09-13 (#589); until then it held the pre-reconciliation fief mapping for clans 2, 5, 6, 7, 8 and 9 and running the generator would have reverted six party templates. Edit the live files and re-sync; do not hand-edit rosters here. Clans 9 and 11 carry FFFEFEFE rather than the banner's exact FFFFFFFF: FFFFFFFF equals uint.MaxValue, which AgentVisuals_Create_Patch treats as 'no clan colour set', so colour randomness would stay on and the engine would override the clan colour. Do not 'correct' these two back to FFFFFFFF.",
